  "body": "**Blocked by:** #202\n\n## Context\n\nThis issue builds on #202; #204 is the next sequential slice of the `mail-sync-hardening` batch.\n\n## Task\n\nKeep fileAttachment streamed normally. Represent itemAttachment/referenceAttachment in synchronized content with sanitized filename/provider type, deterministic ordering, and reconcile deduplication. Missing names safe.\n\n## Scope\n\n### In scope\n\n- Task deliverables, migrations, integration, tests, and necessary documentation.\n\n### Out of scope\n\n- No embedded-item or OneDrive target fetch.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- Mixed fixture ingests file and surfaces both foreign types.\n- Repeated reconcile no duplicate annotation.\n- Malicious/missing names safe.\n- No placeholder Files row.\n",
